elling after the current flag...\",\"Cartoon\",\"Castle on the Sea\",\"Change access key?\",\"Change Key\",\"Changes all button sizes (40-140). Large sizes may be limited to fit your screen.\",\"Changes every script label immediately and saves for future sessions.\",\"Changes how far you dash\",\"Changes how high your normal jump goes\",\"Changes how the world looks on your screen only.\",\"Changes supported skill-effect colors on your screen only\",\"Changes text in the Blox Fruits interface; the Cokeboys menu stays unchanged\",\"Changes the info shown over the game, not the GUI sidebar.\",\"Changes the menu's colors, not your wallpaper.\",\"Changes the selected part on every on-screen button\",\"Changes the server, session, player, and bounty/honor text together\",\"Changes the target line and FOV circle thickness\",\"CHARACTER\",\"Character changed during travel.\",\"Character data unavailable\",\"Character is not ready.\",\"CHARACTER SERVICES\",\"Character services, Fruit Gacha, and fighting-style purchases in one place.\",\"Chat: type /hide or /e hide to toggle menu + overlays\",\"Checking fruit cooldown when you are out of combat.\",\"Checking image...\",\"Checking the gacha cooldown...\",\"Checking...\",\"Choose 1 to 5 jumps when the next skill needs more height. The jumps begin only after this block's primary or backup skill is accepted. Leave it at None for normal timing.\",\"Choose a config to load it instantly. Changes save automatically, and your last selected config opens next time.\",\"Choose a fighting style first.\",\"Choose a fighting style to begin.\",\"Choose a Preset\",\"Choose a wallpaper\",\"Choose a wallpaper, use your own Roblox image, and customize the menu colors.\",\"Choose exactly which abilities may move the camera below.\",\"Choose Ghoul or Cyborg directly. You must have unlocked that race first.\",\"Choose Melee, Fruit, Sword, or Gun, select 1 to 6 attacks, and place the action before Block 1 or after a block. Fruit M1 follows the equi